# AI rules for this workspace

See AGENTS.md. It is the single source of truth for agent rules here and
is included by CLAUDE.md.

For any UI work, read docs/design-system/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md first.

This file is a pointer on purpose: duplicating the rules across
.cursorrules, .windsurfrules and AGENTS.md guarantees they drift apart,
and a stale rule is worse than no rule.
